  "prompt": "One compact but lush conifer tree for a three-quarter isometric arcade tank battlefield. Layered deep-green boughs with warm sunlit tips, sturdy dark trunk, a few roots and small tan rocks at the foot. The trunk has a clear single ground contact point and the canopy is uneven and natural, not a symmetric triangle. Match the references' chunky outlined pixel clusters and earthy olive, basalt, and cream palette. A free-standing tree silhouette, not a hexagonal tile or raised platform; no vehicle, text, UI, or scene background.",
